    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA wonderful family home ideally positioned on one of Donnybrook's most sought-after roads, 61 Nutley Avenue offers bright, spacious accommodation, a superb south-westerly rear garden, and generous off-street parking.\nUpon entering, one is immediately struck by the abundance of natural light throughout the welcoming hallway. To the left is a large drawing/dining room extending from front to rear, with direct access to the garden. Also on the ground floor is a spacious kitchen/breakfast room with adjoining utility area, again benefitting from excellent light and a wonderful sense of space. The kitchen provides access to both the garage and the rear garden. A guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\nUpstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms together with a family bathroom and separate WC.\nThe rear garden is a particular feature of this home, extending to approximately 22 metres in length and enjoying a highly desirable south-westerly orientation. Mainly laid in lawn, it offers excellent privacy and ample space for family living and entertaining. To the front, a spacious driveway provides valuable off-street parking.\nWhile the property has been well maintained over the years, it would now benefit from modernisation and upgrading, presenting a superb opportunity to create a substantial family home on a generous site along Nutley Avenue.\nNutley Avenue is a premier residential road with a wealth of amenities on it's doorstep. There is an excellent selection of restaurants nearby as well as public transport links to the city centre including a good bus service on the Merrion Road and Nutley Lane. Sydney Parade DART Station is also close to hand. St Vincent's University Hospital, Merrion Shopping Centre and Elm Park Golf Club are all within walking distance. Also in the immediate area there are a number of popular primary and secondary schools including St Michaels College, Blackrock College and St Conleths, St Teresians and UCD Belfield Campus."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorched Entrance - \nTiled floor and door through to the\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.2m x 5.2m\nBright spacious hallway off which there is a guest w.c and access to reception room and kitchen.\n\nGuest W.C. - \nwith w.c. and wash hand basin\n\nDrawing / Dining Room - 3.3m x 9.6m\nExcellent reception room running from front to back with window to front and doors out to the rear garden. There is a wet room located of this room.\n\nWet Room - \nMira Triton T90 electric shower, w.c. and wash hand basin\n\nKitchen - 2.2m x 6.5m\nSpacious kitchen with a range of eye & floor level units, double oven, hob and window overlooking the rear.\n\nBreakfast Room / Utility Area - 2.8m x 6.2m\nGood bright space with utility area off with provision for washing machine and dryer. Door to internal storage and garage.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - \nSpacious landing with large window providing excellent light.\n\nBedroom - 3.4m x 3.5m\nWooden flooring with built in wardrobes and window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 3.6m\nWindow overlooking the front and a range of built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.2m x 3m\nDouble bedroom.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.5m x 4.2m\nWindow overlooking the front with built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - \nwith bath with shower attachment, sink unit, Triton T90 power shower and hot press\n\nSeparate W.C. - \nw.c & wash hand basin.\n\nOutside - \n61 Nutley Avenue boasts a wonderful south westerly garden extendng to approx 22m in length. It offers a high degree of privacy and is an excellent space to enjoy outside living and also gives superb potential to extend this substantial home further if desired. There is a garage to the side and separate rear access.To the front, a driveway provides off street parking.\n\nGarage - 5.2m x 3.1m\nExcellent space offering good potential and can be accessed via the front of the property and the breakfast room.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Excellent family home extending to approximately 157sq.m (1,690sq.ft)</li><li>Wonderfully bright accommodation throughout</li><li>Stunning south westerly private rear garden</li><li>Large reception room running front to back and four spacious bedrooms</li><li>Garage to side and side access</li><li>Oil central heating </li><li>In need of modernisation thoughout </li><li>Location second to none on this sought after residential road close to every conceivable amenity</ul>"
      },
